OL,3,GNEWSAStolen van driven wrong way forced
OL,4,Aoff road by police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a van was
OL,7,Fdriven the wrong way along a major road
OL,8,Fbefore police later gave chase and
OL,9,Fforced it off the road.
OL,11,FKent Police said it was called after
OL,12,Freports someone had stolen the vehicle
OL,13,Ffrom an address in Swanscombe,
OL,14,FDartford, on Sunday afternoon.
OL,16,FThe van was spotted travelling against
OL,17,Fthe flow of traffic on the A20 before a
OL,18,Fpursuit that ended in Bromley, London,
OL,19,Fwhen a Metropolitan Police car made
OL,20,F"tactical contact" with the vehicle to
OL,21,Fbring it to a stop.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
