OL,3,GNEWSAStolen van driven wrong way forced
OL,4,Aoff road by police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 23-year-old man from Swanley was
OL,7,Farrested on suspicion of aggravated
OL,8,Fvehicle taking, criminal damage,
OL,9,Fdangerous driving, driving whilst
OL,10,Fdisqualified and failing to stop for
OL,11,Fpolice.
